After finishing some ascensions in the devnull tournament (hat trick with
bells on WITHOUT server scumming) I decided to have some fun :)
Since I've done food less and eidolos was describing how to actually play
one I decided to give it a try.
And why not throw in some additional conducts, everyone knows that conducts
are fun (aren't they :).

So I rolled a Mon-Hum-Fem-Neu and decide to go for weaponless, foodless,
genoless, polyless (both poly conducts) and illiterate. First try ended with
a nice little bone file with juiblex in mines town, he wasn't that bad but I had
to pray to get rid of disease and there goes the prayer timeout for food.
Second monk, a nice little bone file in gnomish and I see a purple h running up
to me with high speed, so yeah, try to melee, don't really care if I die, its
an early game anyway and I've broken my ascension streak when going for conducts
anyway, that ends with me dying foolishly.
Third try, second level, second room, a lot of jackals, I get to about 4 hp,
I start running and then decide to quaff the uncursed healing I started with.
Of course one of these gave me a wish and hello blessed fixed =oSD.

Head to mines town, do the normal stuff (price id and check light store).
Found a preblessed magic lamp. Hello PYEC. Nothing fun happens when clearing
sokoban (gave me a BoH). Back to mines, get luck stone, nothing special.
So I have MR, no reflection and not high enough level to quest (and no way to
dispose of kaen either). So I dive for castle nothing eventful, dig when
reaching medusa's island.
Find a nice minotaur pretty close (they are tough when you
have 80 max hp and -10 AC, and cant hit for shit with mithril on). Zap with
sleep, move away, take off robe, off with mithril, on with robe, start
bashing. Then I find the stairs up, I go up and kill medusa.
Break perseus statue and find reflection.
Thats nice but I was also hoping for boots of levitation.
This is about the point when the first hunger starts kicking in. Off with
=oSD, wait for weak, #pray.
Continue diving for castle, there I am a big castle, some nice
cute eels, some sharks, some soldiers, a couple of dragons and some liches.
And I realize, "hey I forgot to bring that flute I found earlier".
Thats around the point when I start to panic, and when in panic the best way
to solve that situation is of course to save and take a break, so thats what I
do. So 30min later I log back on. Still no clue of what to do, so I start
roaming the levels above and I find a nice poly trap, tame 2 dogs, poly pile
some pets and that yields in one Arch lich named Barbie (he was actually male
though), and a black dragon named Blackie. Head back to castle to check more
closely if there is anything I can use to get entrance. Then realize that
there's a nice looking 0 below the stairs up.
A couple of zaps with digging and I have the square in front of the entrance
to castle non liquid :). A bit of fighting (with me running upstairs every
time I have any @'s next to me (and handling them upstairs, I still want the
xp and don't want the pets to steal it all).

Half an hour later, a couple of close calls and castle is cleared (at least
the west part). The pet dragon died when clearing castle, I'm not completely
sure exactly when but he died anyhow :(.
When #sit:ing on the throne I get a wish, so I wish for the Orb of Fate and
amazingly I get it (I usually have bad luck when I during the tournament, and
I had 2 artefacts spawned already, PYEC and Excalibur (from a bone file))).
Zap the wand of wishing, wish for =oLevi. Then I try to decide what else to
wish for but couldn't decide, so I went to do some gehennom exploration.
Nothing interesting there, clear vlads tower, mark the vibrating square... The
normal stuff one would expect. Time to try the quest! First parts are the same
as usually, bash some stuff, find stairs. First try on kaen. I walk up in
range of him, zap with /oDeath and miss, on with levitation, levitating over
the lava hoping that the pet will kill him. (Barbie was by now a level 37 arch
lich with 296 hp). Kaen kills barbie and I start to panic so I invoke the orb
of weight and off I go (without Kaen since I was levitating over lava and made
sure he wasn't close to me).
Then I started realizing that I had no real way of killing Kaen, so I went
back to mines town, and price identify some rings, hoping for a =oConflict and a
=oFA. Had neither of those. I started climbing back to the main branch again 
and something drops another ring, so I head back to mines town to price id.
Was pretty happy about it being base 200
And it's non cursed, so I find a gelatinous cube, put it on, and start hitting
"You momentarily stiffen.", PERFECT.
I decided to try on Kaen again with some help of a !oPara and a couple of
!oSleeping. Wished for =oConflict at that point cause hey thats a fun ring
isn't it! And it helps reduce damage from surrounding monsters.
This was the point when I felt like it doesn't matter if I die
anymore, cause there aren't much left to do anyway. Low HP (90 max hp), the
only gain level/energy I had blew up when trying to alchemize and gehennom
already mapped. So I head down the stairs, smack kaen with a !oPara and use my
stethoscope on him (level 24, 177 hp, ac-14). Nasty. Start hitting him, he
wakes up and gets me from 97->73 health in one turn. Hit him with a !oSleep,
continue hitting, and down he goes.

Perfect! gehennom time :).
Continue killing rodney, no big deal, tele down, clear sanctum, nothing
dangerous except a purple lich trying to welcome me, he curses some items but
thats about it. Zap high priest with death. Nothing Happens. Oops out of
charges and low on hp (60, 100-ish maxhp) and ants surrounding me. Get my one
and only b!oFH and a !oPara while I'm at it. Bash the high priest with it and
continue dealing damage, at around 100hp left he wakes up, so I get a
!oSleeping and hit him with that, and then finish him. Get amulet start
