fate, find the ^ and off to air I go.
I get to the right side of the map with no problems, no engulfings.
Some random monsters show up though (a master mind flayer and a dragon and
some other random stuff).
I continue running to the side with nothing special happening.
At the other side I see the h trigger the portal, hooray,
I have the portal to plane of fire but a master flayer will be
there to greet me. I go through the flayer is 3 squares from me and I just
levitate to the other direction. At the middle of the map and nothing
dangerous close to me I apply the orb again and find the portal.
Plane of water, nothing special...

When entering astral I get greeted by a purple L which I dispose of fast.
Zap the wand of wishing, Nothing Happens. So ok it was 1:1 when it was
